palace|Royal residence boundary is retained without equating all grand houses with palaces. Courtyard cleaning and visitor location align; the passive continuous example is not turned into a grammar rule.
vary|Intransitive differences and deliberate transitive variation are distinct constructions, not tense splits. The second boundary is an editorial proposal beyond explicit Oxford ordinal coverage and is marked without an ordinal.
wolf|Animal meaning and irregular plural checked; often avoids a universal pack claim. Vietnamese ranger observation preserves location and does not invent aggression or a species-level identity.
backing|Support meaning stays broader than financial funding, with an example that does not assert money changed hands. Vietnamese hậu thuẫn is standalone; from/for objects and uncountability align.
employer|Hiring actor is distinguished from worker. Organization interpretation fits flexible working hours; Vietnamese retains the offer and holiday context without introducing paid leave or legal entitlement.
